WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,680
Open treasure chest

2
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,940
Congratulations to user Dugu Qiufei

3
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,340
Get metal weapon

4
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,180
Iron blocks turn into weapons, nails turn into stone

5
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,260
machete ready-made clothes

6
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,380
