23
00:01:47,670 --> 00:01:52,470
Beard nonsense

24
00:01:52,470 --> 00:01:56,650
There's one inside

25
00:01:56,650 --> 00:01:59,900
black stone

26
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,580
Take a look at your black stone
